    "body": "This is a larger problem with the navigate algorithm I think so I'm not really sure how we want to go about addressing this. If we're going to fix instance-by-instance I'd probably not add a note for now and maybe do that once the entire algorithm has been vetted. (Or if we decide to switch things around in Fetch to not return opaque responses for the navigate algorithm.)",
